logs/leg_shadow/
logs/leg_shadow_pc_test/
logs/go2_knee/
logs/combiner_key/
logs/combiner_key_arm/
# The wrist camera's keyhole calibration against the key's touch, kept on the dog between runs (`insert_plan.py`).
logs/combiner_key_calibration/
# The foot-press program's runs (`d1fetch`, and its PC tests) and the key holster's; the recorded copies are the evidence.
logs/leg_press/
logs/combiner_key_holster/
# Top-level console logs of demo and test runs; the recorded copies are the evidence.
logs/*.out
# The D1 arm's timing tests, the front camera's calibration captures and the holster motion's dog runs, copied back by
